---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Software
description: Desktop apps for ASCEND teams — the RC configurator, the Flight Lab RC simulator, the YELLOWSTONE ground station, and other tools.
permalink: /software/
---
<div class="container">
<nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Software</span></nav>
<header class="section-hero"><span class="eyebrow">Download & set up</span><div class="section-hero-row"><div><h1>Software</h1><p class="lead">Desktop apps for setting up your equipment, updating firmware, practicing, and planning flights. Downloads come from each app's latest release on GitHub, so you always get the current version.</p></div><span class="section-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#i-download"/></svg></span></div></header>

{% for group in software.groups %}
<section class="section-block software-group" aria-labelledby="software-{{ group.id }}">
<div class="section-heading"><div><h2 id="software-{{ group.id }}">{{ group.title }}</h2><p>{{ group.intro }}</p></div></div>
<div class="resource-grid two">
{% for app in software.apps %}{% if app.group == group.id %}
<article class="resource-card software-card">
<div class="card-top"><span class="resource-kind"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-download"/></svg>Desktop app</span>{% if app.status %}<span class="status">{{ app.status }}</span>{% endif %}</div>
<h3>{{ app.name }}</h3>
<p>{{ app.summary }}</p>
<ul class="software-platforms" aria-label="Platforms">{% for platform in app.platforms %}<li>{{ platform }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
{% if app.note %}<p class="small">{{ app.note }}</p>{% endif %}
{% if app.download or app.guide or app.source %}<div class="software-actions">{% if app.download %}<a class="button" href="{{ app.download }}">Download latest<span class="visually-hidden"> {{ app.name }}</span></a>{% endif %}{% if app.guide %}<a class="button outline" href="{{ app.guide }}">Setup guide<span class="visually-hidden"> for {{ app.name }}</span></a>{% endif %}{% if app.source %}<a class="text-link" href="{{ app.source }}">Source on GitHub<span class="visually-hidden"> for {{ app.name }}</span></a>{% endif %}</div>{% endif %}
</article>
{% endif %}{% endfor %}
</div>
</section>
{% endfor %}

<p class="notice"><strong>Before you update firmware</strong>Remove the propeller and disconnect the flight battery. After any receiver or flight controller update, check every control direction, the throttle safety, and the failsafe before flight.</p>
</div>
